SunSpec model definitions
-------------------------

The simulator holds no model definitions of its own: Build, Example,
AllModels, NotImplemented and the tests take point offsets and types
from the tables of
github.com/cB-Sigma/sunspec, which are derived from the SunSpec
Alliance's model definitions (github.com/sunspec/models, commit
90b4a331dcca1d6eac69c1bead952fddcc5852e0, Apache License 2.0); the
sunspec module's NOTICE gives the details and the copyright position.
The demo inverter's register layout follows the same definitions.

