Interop tests (nested module interop/, not part of the simulator)
-----------------------------------------------------------------

The tests install pysunspec2 1.3.6 from PyPI (Apache License 2.0, by the
SunSpec Alliance) into a python:3.12.10-slim container while they run.
Neither pysunspec2 nor the image is redistributed, and no pysunspec2 code
is in this repository; testdata/pysunspec2_client.py is our own script
that calls it.

Test data
---------

The demo inverter (sim.DemoInverter, cmd/sunspecsim) uses made-up
identity and values ("Example Solar", "ES-10K-3P", "DEMO000001"). The
inverter image in sunspec_test.go uses a real manufacturer's name and
model name as text only, with made-up serial and register values.
